---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout sideBarActiveItemID="about">
  <div class="pb-12 mt-5">
    <div class="text-5xl font-bold mb-2">About Our Family Shop</div>
    <div class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Faithful Craftsmen</div>
    <div class="text-lg mb-6">
      We are a small family shop—Dad and three sons—working together to build, create, and learn. Our journey is rooted in faith, family, and the beautiful art of woodworking. Every project is a chance to grow closer, learn new skills, and share our passion for craftsmanship with others.
      <br/><br/>
      Our workshop is more than a place to make things—it's where we carve out memories, pass down traditions, and celebrate the joy of working side by side. We believe in quality, creativity, and the blessings that come from building together as a family.
    </div>
    <div class="text-lg mb-6">
      I am a devoted Christian, a loving father of three sons, and a new woodworker with a passion for crafting more than just beautiful pieces of art. This blog documents our family’s journey as we navigate our Christian lives, drawing inspiration from our faith in God to create not only stunning wooden masterpieces but also a strong, values-driven family bond. Join us as we delve into our woodworking adventures, from designing and handcrafting custom furniture that graces homes with warmth and character, to intricate pens that tell a story in every stroke. Here, we celebrate the intersection of faith, family, and craftsmanship, and the joy that emerges when we dedicate our hands and hearts to God's glory. Every piece we create is a reflection of our faith and an extension of our family’s love. Discover the woodworking tips we've learned along the way, the life lessons that this craft teaches us daily, and the unwavering dedication we hold towards nurturing our Christian values in ourselves and our children. In every post, we strive to inspire fellow Christian woodworkers and families alike, encouraging a life where faith and craftmanship coalesce into something truly divine.
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-6">
        <div class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Dad (Your Name)</div>
        <div class="text-base">Founder, mentor, and chief craftsman. Passionate about woodworking, teaching, and guiding my sons on this journey of faith and creativity.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-6">
        <div class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Son #1 (Name)</div>
        <div class="text-base">Loves hands-on projects, always curious and eager to learn new skills in the shop.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-6">
        <div class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Son #2 (Name)</div>
        <div class="text-base">Creative thinker, enjoys designing and bringing new ideas to life with wood and tools.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-6">
        <div class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Son #3 (Name)</div>
        <div class="text-base">The youngest craftsman, full of energy and excitement for every new project.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-lg mb-6">
      Thank you for visiting our virtual workshop. We hope our story and our work inspire you as much as this journey inspires us. If you’d like to connect, collaborate, or just say hello, we’d love to hear from you!
    </div>
    <a class="btn" href="mailto:info@faithfulcraftsmen.com">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
